1
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:35,760
If Zeng Muhan hadn't stepped up

2
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,000
in the final stage,

3
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,680
we never could have completed

4
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:40,280
the siege of the town government.

5
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,240
So,

6
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:44,000
speaking purely as the commander of my battalion,

7
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,200
this battle was lost long ago.

8
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,600
In this exercise,

9
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:51,480
Zeng Muhan alone

10
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,400
has already contributed more

11
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,880
than you, the Battalion Commander.

12
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,480
You truly failed your duty as Battalion Commander.

13
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:58,800
Yes.

14
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,040
I am willing to take full responsibility

15
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,560
and accept any punishment.

16
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,400
For the issues exposed by the Wind Rider Battalion

17
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,320
this time around,

18
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,080
you are partly to blame,

19
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,000
but the main responsibility is mine.

20
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,080
Like you, I wanted to win too much.

21
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,080
I was too eager to see the results

22
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,360
of the New Quality Combat Capability.

23
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,440
Your self-criticism,

24
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:21,560
I accept it.

25
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,680
As for my self-criticism,

26
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,080
please pass it to the Comrades in the battalion.

27
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,480
Sir,

28
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,880
aren't you just putting us to shame?

29
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:35,160
If you make a mistake, you must admit it.

30
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:37,720
My biggest mistake was

31
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,840
letting your initial performance

32
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,760
go to my head.

33
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,440
Before the modules in your Magic Cube

34
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,720
were fully built,

35
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:45,840
I rushed to turn it,

36
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,400
and damaged the main axis.

37
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,160
Guo Zijian, do you know?

38
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,320
I wanted so badly for everyone

39
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,480
to acknowledge your Magic Cube theory sooner.

40
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,040
I was too impatient.

41
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,480
Now some people are making sarcastic remarks.

42
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,760
Saying I, Liang Beihua, after four years

43
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,040
as Deputy Army Commander, am retiring soon.

44
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:08,000
And that my eagerness for success

45
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,080
is just to get one more promotion.

46
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,800
They're half right.

47
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,680
I am about to retire.

48
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,480
What I want to do before I retire

49
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,040
is to help push forward

50
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,160
the Army's reform,

51
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:20,040
and do my modest part.

52
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:22,160
Sir,

53
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,680
it's still our fault in the end

54
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,400
for making you lose face.

55
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,720
My pride doesn't matter.

56
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,880
The pride of Chinese soldiers is what matters.

57
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,400
Remember,

58
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,880
every choice we make today,

59
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,960
and every step we take,

60
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,400
is a reflection of the Chinese army's

61
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:50,280
military reform achievements.

62
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:52,840
Letting go of oneself

63
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:54,960
is easier said than done.

64
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:56,720
But we are soldiers.

65
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:58,440
Being a soldier

66
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,920
means dedication and sacrifice.

67
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,640
Therefore,

68
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,840
you must let go of what needs to be let go.

69
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,720
Understood.

70
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:08,760
Guo Zijian,

71
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,800
I'll leave you with this,

72
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,280
for both of us to keep in mind.

73
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,200
Please go ahead, Sir.

74
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,320
We are soldiers.

75
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:20,160
Our calling is to win battles.

76
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:23,360
If we only focus on winning and losing,

77
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,720
we will only drift further away

78
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,680
from true victory.

79
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,120
I understand what you mean.

80
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:37,040
Go back.

81
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,800
Take your Magic Cube

82
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,240
and turn it into even greater value.

83
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,320
Yes, Sir.

84
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:13,400
Battalion Commander.

85
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,320
What's on your mind?

86
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,040
I was thinking...

87
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:22,120
We've been training in the field for a while now.

88
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,360
Our joint ops in mountain and forest terrain,

89
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,960
including urban attack and defense,

90
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,440
have shown pretty good results.

91
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,680
Air assault and long-range artillery

92
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,560
coordination has also greatly improved.

93
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,240
So...

94
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,120
So?

95
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,880
Is it time

96
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:38,200
to switch to a new map?

97
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:45,960
Wind Rider Bn. SE Coast Training Request

98
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,520
I'll show Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

99
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,800
If this gets approved,

100
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,720
I'll make sure you get the credit.

101
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:12,040
Reporting.

102
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,000
Come in.

103
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,000
You're here, Comrade Jian'an.

104
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:17,680
Sir.

105
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,120
Have a seat.

106
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:18,640
Yes, sir.

107
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:27,680
Here, have some water.

108
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:28,240
Okay.

109
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,160
Sit, sit.

110
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,360
I called you over specifically

111
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,240
to brief you on a few things.

112
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,280
First, regarding the Wind Rider Battalion

113
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:41,160
training on the Southeast Coast.

114
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,120
The Group Army commander gave his approval

115
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,520
and agreed to their request.

116
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:45,240
Yes, sir.

117
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:47,080
For this training project,

118
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,040
they need to balance

119
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:50,280
research for military academies,

120
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:52,440
as well as some

121
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,520
equipment R&D for defense industries.

122
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,440
So, the task is very heavy.

123
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,520
Sir, to be honest,

124
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,320
I feel

125
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,080
a heavy burden on my shoulders.

126
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,040
Don't feel pressured.

127
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:05,800
The Group Army leaders trust your ability.

128
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,880
Thank you for the commanders' trust.

129
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,240
For this training,

130
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:11,920
due to quota limits,

131
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,440
Jiang Shengqiang's

132
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,120
Hurricane Battalion won't be going.

133
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:17,120
Xu Lingjun arranged for the Chief of Staff

134
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,960
to oversee their training.

135
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,080
Don't worry about it.

136
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:19,960
Yes, sir.

137
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,160
Also,

138
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,480
there's an order

139
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:24,520
I need you to relay verbally to Guo Zijian.

140
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,680
Word for word.

141
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:26,520
Yes, sir.

142
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,520
Once the Wind Rider Battalion sets out,

143
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,720
until returning to base,

144
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:32,040
they must keep level-3 readiness or higher.

145
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,040
Of course,

146
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,120
they can still rest,

147
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,320
but the battalion's Alert Unit

148
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,000
must be maintained.

149
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:37,560
Yes, sir.

150
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,840
This order was issued by me,

151
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,000
and only I can lift it.

152
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,280
Yes, sir.

153
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,840
I will relay it as soon as I get back.

154
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:45,680
Sit.

155
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,120
I heard

156
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:53,800
from Kang Baoping

157
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,720
that after the last exercise,

158
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,640
your attitude towards Comrade Guo Zijian

159
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:59,600
has changed somewhat.

160
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:01,280
Tell me why.

161
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,560
Yes, sir.

162
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,840
Actually, Guo Zijian and I

163
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:10,080
have no personal grudge.

164
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,720
I've always been

165
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:13,200
objective.

166
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,160
You see,

167
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,080
Guo Zijian's

168
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,360
past performance

169
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:18,040
is clear to everyone.

170
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:18,960
Right?

171
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,360
However,

172
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,320
after interacting with him recently,

173
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,200
I found that this kid

174
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:26,400
really impressed me.

175
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,560
His flaws are obvious,

176
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,600
but his strengths stand out more.

177
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,440
Some of his methods

178
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:34,000
even made me

179
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,000
re-examine

180
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,200
myself.

181
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,520
I actually think

182
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,440
some of my past working methods

183
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:42,080
were problematic.

184
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,720
Do you really think so?

185
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:45,480
I do.

186
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,120
Good.

187
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,160
Let me show you something.

188
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:54,840
Here, read this letter.

189
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:03,720
A whistleblower letter

190
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,320
against Guo Zijian.

191
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,040
Right.

192
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,600
Forwarded by the newspaper.

193
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:10,160
About falsification during the exercise.

194
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,680
Setting the record straight, so to speak.

195
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:13,320
Sir.

196
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:15,480
Then what can we do now?

197
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:17,120
Cooperate with disciplinary inspection.

198
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,320
Am I to assist the investigation?

199
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,120
Yes.

200
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,680
That doesn't seem quite appropriate.

201
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,960
The Group Army Party Committee decided it.

202
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:28,760
So

203
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,600
you need to produce a

204
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,320
report that reflects your Party spirit.

205
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,520
All right.

206
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,360
I will do my best.

207
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:39,320
Sir.

208
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,680
If you have any difficulties,

209
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:44,120
just say so.

210
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,040
Don't beat around the bush.

211
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,000
I'd like to ask

212
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:50,200
about Comrade Liu Wangyuan's

213
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,600
position transfer.

214
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:56,680
Transferring Comrade Liu Wangyuan from

215
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,480
head of Operations and Training Section to

216
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,000
head of the Troop Management Section

217
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,880
was your Brigade Party Committee's idea.

218
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,960
It's just that right now he...

219
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:06,400
Operations and Training Section is huge.

220
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:07,840
The military tasks are too heavy.

221
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,840
Comrade Liu Wangyuan is clearly not suited for it.

222
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,400
Yes.

223
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:12,360
The Group Army Party Committee agreed.

224
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:15,680
The issue is,

225
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,080
he himself

226
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,360
still can't fully accept it.

227
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,080
Right.

228
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:21,080
He's bound to be a bit unsettled.

229
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,120
After you go back,

230
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:23,960
you need to counsel him properly.

231
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,280
Yes.

232
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,520
Rest assured, Sir.

233
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:27,520
I will do my best.

234
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,160
Good.

235
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,240
Report!

236
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,760
Come in.

237
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,600
Brother, what's this about?

238
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:43,560
Deputy Brigade Commander.

239
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,120
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

240
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,200
I don't understand.

241
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,280
It's about your transfer.

242
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:53,600
I've been in the military for so many years.

243
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:55,680
I've worked hard and diligently.

244
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,960
I finally made it step by step

245
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,720
to get to where I am today.

246
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,920
What exactly did I do wrong

247
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,200
for you to banish me to

248
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,360
the Troop Management Section?

249
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,400
How is this a banishment?

250
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,520
It's a normal transfer.

251
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:09,560
A lateral move.

252
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:12,200
It sounds nice to call it a lateral move.

253
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,080
But who among us doesn't know

254
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,440
that the Troop Management Section

255
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,200
isn't the Operations and Training Section?

256
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,480
Now you want me to go back to management

257
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,400
and logistics?

258
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:21,640
I might as well

259
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,280
have stayed 1st Battalion Commander!

260
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,200
Doesn't this completely block

261
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,200
my room for promotion?

262
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,080
Tell me the truth.

263
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,640
Did someone

264
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:33,200
go to the higher-ups

265
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:33,960
to rat me out

266
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,560
and complain about me?

267
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:37,960
You're overthinking it.

268
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,480
I, Liu Wangyuan,

269
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:42,600
act with integrity

270
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:43,480
and have nothing to hide.

271
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:45,640
If you insist that I have a problem,

272
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:46,840
it's just that I

273
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,320
am too principled

274
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,160
and easily offend people.

275
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:50,120
But if someone has an issue,

276
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,680
they can tell me to my face.

277
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,760
Why must they stab me in the back

278
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,040
and snitch to the higher-ups?

279
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:57,920
Unbelievable.

280
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:58,720
Fine then.

281
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,880
Tomorrow I'll go to the Group Army too.

282
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,800
I'll use my connections.

283
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:02,560
I'll talk to the leaders.

284
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:04,040
I'll turn this around no matter what.

285
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:04,920
Who will you talk to?

286
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,520
Are you done?

287
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:10,920
Who will you talk to? Tell me.

288
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:11,840
Who are you going to?

289
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,640
You think you're so capable now?

290
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,280
Just for a job transfer,

291
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:17,240
you're going to the leaders

292
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,480
to pull some strings?

293
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,000
Liu Wangyuan!

294
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,160
You've disappointed me so much.

295
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:34,480
I'm not just doing this for myself.

296
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,000
Think about it.

297
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:39,200
You trained me yourself.

298
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:40,760
If they treat me like this,

299
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,480
isn't that a slap in your face too?

300
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:44,600
The military isn't for forming cliques.

301
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:46,560
Let me tell you,

302
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,920
regarding your transfer,

303
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,240
the Brigade Party Committee

304
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,560
and the Group Army leaders

305
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:51,920
made a unanimous decision.

306
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:53,640
Just tell me,

307
00:12:54,680 --> 00:12:55,560
do you accept it or not?

308
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:02,040
Sit down.

309
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:15,200
Freshly brewed.

310
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:20,640
Look, Wangyuan.

311
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,480
Why did the higher-ups do this?

312
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:26,400
They were considering your future.

313
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:29,080
What are your strengths?

314
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:32,640
You're thorough.

315
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:35,520
Detail-oriented.

316
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,480
Good at communicating.

317
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,680
Good at coordinating.

318
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:40,360
Transferring to Troop Management Section

319
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:42,200
perfectly plays to your strengths, doesn't it?

320
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:44,200
Am I right?

321
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:46,840
Besides,

322
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:48,480
Throughout history,

323
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:50,160
how many great figures

324
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:51,720
have had their ups and downs?

325
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:54,040
Many bided their time before succeeding.

326
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:56,040
Let me tell you, Liu Wangyuan.

327
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,200
If I were you,

328
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,360
I'd work hard,

329
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:00,720
achieve results,

330
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,040
and use those results

331
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,760
to prove my capability.

332
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,800
I'd make them transfer me back.

333
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:06,600
Make them beg me to go back.

334
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:07,600
Understand?

335
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,480
If you wait until then,

336
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,320
it's not impossible

337
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:22,200
for things to turn around.

338
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:24,480
The new section chief hasn't arrived yet.

339
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,720
You still need to hold your post.

340
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:28,440
Understood?

341
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:34,800
Understood.

342
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:38,280
Will you obey?

343
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:40,880
I will.

344
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:41,440
Good.

345
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:43,600
Come on,

346
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:44,880
drink up.

347
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:52,880
Alright, you can go now.

348
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:53,560
I have work to do.

349
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:59,360
I'll go back and process this, then.

350
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:00,720
Permission granted.

351
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:27,800
Now,

352
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:30,400
please welcome our Battalion Commander

353
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:35,320
to reorganize Wind Rider Battalion's staff

354
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:38,840
according to the Magic Cube.

355
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:46,520
Comrades,

356
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:48,760
In order to better

357
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,320
and more quickly complete

358
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:52,200
the construction of the Magic Cube,

359
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:54,440
and because we are a

360
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:57,560
forward-looking and exploratory unit,

361
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:59,360
with our superiors' approval,

362
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:00,480
we are establishing

363
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:03,240
three temporary combat teams.

364
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:06,200
Company commanders will be team leaders,

365
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,240
and the combat arm company commanders

366
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:09,280
will uniformly become

367
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:10,880
combat arm advising staff officers.

368
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:13,120
This structure is time-phased.

369
00:16:13,920 --> 00:16:15,600
After basic individual training,

370
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:18,080
it's only used in combined arms training.

371
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,320
When the troops

372
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:23,200
enter the next training cycle,

373
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:24,600
each company

374
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,120
will return to its original structure.

375
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:28,000
Since it's a Magic Cube,

376
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,280
everyone must

377
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:30,760
adapt as quickly as possible

378
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:32,240
to this dynamic

379
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:33,600
combination mode.

380
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:35,320
I believe

381
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,320
the men of the Wind Rider Battalion

382
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:39,440
will all quickly adapt

383
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:42,840
to the Magic Cube's combat operation.

384
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:43,880
Meanwhile,

385
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,720
Wind Rider Battalion is a new-quality one,

386
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:49,440
so all new-quality combat units

387
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:52,120
will remain under battalion command.

388
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:53,880
However, a few individual units

389
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,920
will undergo minor adjustments.

390
00:16:55,520 --> 00:16:56,040
For example,

391
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:59,360
after recon branches merge into companies,

392
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:00,960
the battalion's Special Operations Platoon

393
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,360
will take on

394
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:04,200
more special operations functions.

395
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:05,680
Special Operations Platoon!

396
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:07,400
Are you confident?

397
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:08,560
Yes!

398
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:09,760
Good.

399
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:11,400
That's all I have to say

400
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:12,400
for now.

401
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:12,800
Next,

402
00:17:13,040 --> 00:17:14,080
please welcome the Political Instructor

403
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:15,680
to announce the appointments.

404
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,560
As submitted by the Battalion Party Committee

405
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,240
and decided by the Brigade Party Committee,

406
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:25,400
effective today,

407
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:27,960
Reconnaissance Staff Officer Zeng Muhan

408
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:31,160
will command the battalion's 1st Company.

409
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:33,640
Since Comrade Zeng Muhan is highly capable,

410
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:34,400
therefore,

411
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:37,560
until a new recon staff officer is chosen,

412
00:17:37,800 --> 00:17:38,920
Comrade Zeng Muhan

413
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:41,880
will act as interim recon staff officer.

414
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:44,480
And the Special Operations Platoon's

415
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:46,440
Acting Platoon Leader Yang Maolin

416
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,440
will serve as a staff assistant

417
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:51,320
and take on some staff functions.

418
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:04,040
Comrades,

419
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:06,240
for this trip,

420
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,720
since we are tasked with

421
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:10,160
military research missions for academies,

422
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:12,160
our mode of travel

423
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:14,240
will differ from the past.

424
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:16,720
But whichever method it is,

425
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:18,160
for everyone here,

426
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:20,040
it will be a new experience.

427
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:22,560
Comrades,

428
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:25,200
see you at the Southeast Coast!

429
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:27,520
See you at the Southeast Coast!

430
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:34,160
Captain Jing is back.

431
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,360
Chief.

432
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:43,720
Jing Xiaochun reporting for duty.

433
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:46,040
I called you back from leave so urgently

434
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,400
because there's an important mission.

435
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:48,400
It has to be you.

436
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,760
What mission?

437
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:51,480
We received a report

438
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:54,040
that a group of unidentified criminals

439
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:55,800
has colluded with drug traffickers

440
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:56,880
and is attempting to sneak into our city.

441
00:18:57,560 --> 00:18:58,560
Your mission

442
00:18:58,560 --> 00:19:00,120
is to coordinate with the SWAT team.

443
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:02,680
Here is the specific plan.

444
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:49,400
Sir.

445
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:52,040
Why don't you go check the camp?

446
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:53,880
Why would I go to the camp?

447
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:55,760
Isn't this fine?

448
00:19:56,280 --> 00:19:57,320
It's calm and relaxing.

449
00:19:58,600 --> 00:20:00,080
Sir, I do think

450
00:20:00,320 --> 00:20:01,480
if you go there to see them off,

451
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:03,440
the troops' morale would soar.

452
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,680
Now is not the time to boost morale.

453
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:07,800
Is the heavy equipment loaded?

454
00:20:08,280 --> 00:20:09,440
It was loaded onto flatbeds yesterday.

455
00:20:10,120 --> 00:20:11,440
The other units are preparing to use

456
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,920
Y-20 for long-range transport.

457
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:14,640
Both planes are in position.

458
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,920
Ready for boarding at any time.

459
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:19,160
What about Guo Zijian and Liang Hong?

460
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:21,040
They're already on their way to the airport.

461
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:22,280
Sir,

462
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:24,040
when will the mission be issued?

463
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:26,280
Before they board the plane,

464
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:27,080
stop them,

465
00:20:27,080 --> 00:20:28,080
and issue the mission.

466
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:28,880
Yes.

467
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:34,640
Copy that.

468
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:36,120
Battalion Commander,

469
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:37,640
the main force has arrived at the airport.

470
00:20:37,760 --> 00:20:39,280
Good. Order them to board immediately.

471
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:39,560
Yes.

472
00:20:40,760 --> 00:20:41,720
Attention all units,

473
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:42,520
board immediately.

474
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:49,200
Brigade Commander,

475
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:54,320
are you joking?

476
00:20:54,840 --> 00:20:56,080
I'm almost at the airport.

477
00:20:56,120 --> 00:20:57,240
The boarding order has been given.

478
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,320
Who's joking with you?

479
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:58,960
I'm telling you,

480
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,800
I will assign someone

481
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:02,080
to oversee the boarding.

482
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:04,120
I guarantee all boarding personnel

483
00:21:04,320 --> 00:21:05,280
will be delivered safely.

484
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:06,880
But you, Liang Hong,

485
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:08,040
and some Special Operations Platoon men

486
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:09,120
must take a new route

487
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:10,800
and transport method to Haitong City.

488
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:12,680
Understood. Any other requirements?

489
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:15,120
The clock starts now.

490
00:21:15,240 --> 00:21:16,360
Within 24 hours,

491
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,600
you must take a tourist bus

492
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:19,960
to reach Haitong City.

493
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,360
How you get to the militia training center

494
00:21:22,560 --> 00:21:23,400
is up to you.

495
00:21:23,600 --> 00:21:24,080
Understood.

496
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:31,600
Yang Maolin, stop boarding immediately.

497
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:32,400
The mission has changed.

498
00:21:32,800 --> 00:21:34,520
Orders require eight people for this mission.

499
00:21:34,600 --> 00:21:36,120
Pick five from the Special Operations Platoon,

500
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:37,160
and move in plain clothes.

501
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:39,320
We'll meet at the highway intersection.

502
00:21:39,320 --> 00:21:40,760
I'll send you the location shortly.

503
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:41,560
Yes.

504
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,600
There are only two tourist buses

505
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,520
heading to Haitong City.

506
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:47,160
If we want to complete the mission,

507
00:21:47,160 --> 00:21:48,400
we have to catch the first bus.

508
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:55,120
You remember what I just said, right?

509
00:21:55,560 --> 00:21:56,720
Understood. We sit separately on the bus,

510
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,440
and act like strangers.

511
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,320
Three people,

512
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:18,040
right?

513
00:22:18,720 --> 00:22:19,600
Miss, take a seat in the back.

514
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:20,440
The guy behind me is paying.

515
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:21,480
Okay, okay, okay.

516
00:22:22,040 --> 00:22:23,040
Hey man, you're paying, right?

517
00:23:11,120 --> 00:23:12,240
Sorry, sorry.

518
00:23:13,280 --> 00:23:13,760
It's okay.

519
00:23:40,840 --> 00:23:41,520
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

520
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,560
our previous training sites

521
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,240
were either abandoned factories

522
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:46,840
or out in the wilderness.

523
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:48,360
But look at this coastal area's

524
00:23:48,360 --> 00:23:49,360
militia training center.

525
00:23:49,360 --> 00:23:50,560
It's so standardized now.

526
00:23:51,280 --> 00:23:52,680
What's the personnel and equipment status?

527
00:23:52,840 --> 00:23:54,560
Besides Guo Zijian and Staff Officer Liang

528
00:23:54,560 --> 00:23:55,880
and the detachment they're leading,

529
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,360
the troops have been arriving steadily.

530
00:23:58,840 --> 00:23:59,440
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

531
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:01,120
at a time like this,

532
00:24:01,120 --> 00:24:02,760
what special mission could there be?

533
00:24:02,760 --> 00:24:04,320
Why change their route at the last minute?

534
00:24:05,600 --> 00:24:06,600
What the mission is,

535
00:24:06,720 --> 00:24:07,560
I have no idea.

536
00:24:07,840 --> 00:24:08,720
All I know is

537
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:10,840
that before 10:15 tomorrow morning,

538
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:12,280
they must arrive.

539
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:17,040
You won't make them run here, will you?

540
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:35,320
You think they staged this enemy situation?

541
00:24:36,080 --> 00:24:36,800
It's possible.

542
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:38,480
Let's play it by ear.

543
00:25:13,600 --> 00:25:14,160
Official business.

544
00:25:14,160 --> 00:25:15,480
Please cooperate with the inspection.

545
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:30,800
Wang Yanxia.

546
00:25:32,720 --> 00:25:33,800
That's her. Take her away.

547
00:25:34,080 --> 00:25:34,880
Hey, what are you doing?

548
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:35,360
Move.

549
00:25:36,080 --> 00:25:37,000
Which one is your bag?

550
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:39,080
That white one is my bag.

551
00:25:40,920 --> 00:25:41,520
What are you doing?

552
00:25:41,760 --> 00:25:43,800
Hey, why are you arresting me?

553
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:47,360
Attention, passengers.

554
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,880
We're under orders to arrest drug dealers.

555
00:25:49,080 --> 00:25:49,760
Right now,

556
00:25:49,760 --> 00:25:51,680
we suspect drugs are hidden on this bus.

557
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:53,320
We must conduct a thorough search.

558
00:25:53,320 --> 00:25:54,160
Please cooperate.

559
00:25:58,880 --> 00:25:59,640
Comrade Officer,

560
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:00,680
we have urgent business.

561
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:01,480
Let us off first.

562
00:26:01,680 --> 00:26:03,160
A drug dealer was found on the bus.

563
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:04,920
Until a thorough search is completed,

564
00:26:05,040 --> 00:26:06,760
no one is cleared of suspicion.

565
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:08,240
We're really in a hurry.

566
00:26:08,520 --> 00:26:09,920
Urgent or not, you have to wait.

567
00:26:14,640 --> 00:26:15,720
I have a bad feeling about this.

568
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:31,440
What a coincidence.

569
00:26:35,600 --> 00:26:36,760
We're here on special duty.

570
00:26:39,360 --> 00:26:40,040
Your girlfriend?

571
00:26:44,280 --> 00:26:44,760
Captain Jing.

572
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:47,960
You two know each other?

573
00:27:10,560 --> 00:27:11,360
Whose bag is this?

574
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:12,240
It's my bag.

575
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:17,680
We need to search your bag.

576
00:27:27,800 --> 00:27:28,680
This box isn't mine.

577
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:42,520
You're suspected of drug trafficking.

578
00:27:42,720 --> 00:27:43,600
Please come with us.

579
00:27:44,120 --> 00:27:44,880
Comrade Officer.

580
00:27:45,360 --> 00:27:46,560
The woman who was just taken away

581
00:27:46,560 --> 00:27:47,480
tampered with this bag earlier.

582
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:48,760
I can prove it.

583
00:27:49,040 --> 00:27:50,120
She must have planted the stuff.

584
00:27:51,320 --> 00:27:52,320
Who else can testify?

585
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:53,240
I can testify too.

586
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:53,920
Me too.

587
00:27:54,440 --> 00:27:55,720
Perfect. You're all coming with us

588
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,120
to assist with the investigation.

589
00:27:58,320 --> 00:27:58,920
Driver.

590
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:00,480
Drive to Bishui Villa.

591
00:28:23,600 --> 00:28:24,960
You don't need to show me this.

592
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:26,960
You know who I am.

593
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:28,720
Those people are my subordinates.

594
00:28:28,960 --> 00:28:30,160
They have nothing to do with drug dealers.

595
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:31,920
You've seen the files yourself.

596
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:35,200
The contact photo the drug dealer sent

597
00:28:36,280 --> 00:28:37,680
is exactly your chief staff officer.

598
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:38,840
Furthermore,

599
00:28:40,520 --> 00:28:41,440
inside her bag,

600
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:42,800
we found high-purity drugs.

601
00:28:45,320 --> 00:28:46,160
And you believe that?

602
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:49,280
What I believe doesn't matter.

603
00:28:49,800 --> 00:28:50,800
We follow the law.

604
00:28:50,800 --> 00:28:51,600
And we need evidence.

605
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:54,280
Jing Xiaochun,

606
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:56,760
what right do you have

607
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:57,920
to detain us?

608
00:28:58,120 --> 00:28:59,000
Guo Zijian,

609
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:01,360
how can this be considered detention?

610
00:29:07,520 --> 00:29:08,120
Kill the engine.

611
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:14,120
Have three of your guys go eat dinner first.

612
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:16,200
Then pick us up at the designated location.

613
00:29:20,280 --> 00:29:20,800
Man,

614
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,040
here's the fare.

615
00:29:22,560 --> 00:29:23,880
We pay per trip.

616
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:24,680
No running a tab.

617
00:29:25,560 --> 00:29:26,120
Alright!

618
00:29:27,960 --> 00:29:28,760
You guys stay here for now.

619
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:30,160
As for us,

620
00:29:30,440 --> 00:29:32,240
we've notified military security.

621
00:29:32,760 --> 00:29:33,640
Once they arrive,

622
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:34,800
we'll verify everything ASAP.

623
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:36,200
We'll do our best

624
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:38,120
so that after tonight,

625
00:29:38,280 --> 00:29:39,040
your names will be cleared.

626
00:29:39,400 --> 00:29:40,560
After tonight?

627
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:42,560
We have an emergency mission.

628
00:29:42,560 --> 00:29:43,200
We have to leave.

629
00:29:43,560 --> 00:29:45,560
The drugs were found in Liang Hong's bag.

630
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:47,640
So until the matter is cleared up,

631
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:49,000
talking to me is pointless.

632
00:29:54,680 --> 00:29:55,400
Do you think

633
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:57,720
just the few of you

634
00:29:58,280 --> 00:29:59,360
can stop us?

635
00:29:59,520 --> 00:30:00,520
SWAT is right outside.

636
00:30:00,520 --> 00:30:01,440
Try it if you dare.

637
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:02,200
By the way,

638
00:30:03,120 --> 00:30:04,440
your designated area

639
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:05,280
is limited to the second floor.

640
00:30:05,800 --> 00:30:07,440
Let me know if you need anything.

641
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:09,000
Also,

642
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:11,000
Liang Hong is suspected of drug dealing.

643
00:30:11,320 --> 00:30:12,240
She must stay in isolation

644
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:14,240
and wait for military security

645
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:15,200
to take over.

646
00:30:21,120 --> 00:30:21,600
Fine.

647
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:25,280
We'll cooperate.

648
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:27,600
Thanks for your trouble.

649
00:30:32,600 --> 00:30:33,240
Battalion Commander,

650
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:34,800
they obviously framed Staff Officer Liang.

651
00:30:35,120 --> 00:30:35,640
I know.

652
00:30:35,640 --> 00:30:36,640
Then what do we do now?

653
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:39,720
What should we do?

654
00:30:41,600 --> 00:30:42,480
It's a special situation.

655
00:30:42,760 --> 00:30:44,080
I'll call our superiors later

656
00:30:44,080 --> 00:30:44,920
to explain things.

657
00:30:45,320 --> 00:30:46,240
They shouldn't blame us.

658
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:47,440
Let's go.

659
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:53,840
This Guo Zijian...

660
00:30:54,320 --> 00:30:56,080
is he just not getting it,

661
00:30:56,520 --> 00:30:57,760
or is he trying to slack off?

662
00:30:58,520 --> 00:31:01,520
Urban combat is a modern warfare priority.

663
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:02,920
This kind of drill

664
00:31:03,120 --> 00:31:04,480
is still very meaningful.

665
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:07,440
Deputy Commander Liang,

666
00:31:08,120 --> 00:31:09,760
if Battalion Commander Guo really calls

667
00:31:09,760 --> 00:31:11,280
to request a delay in reporting,

668
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:13,720
wouldn't this drill be for nothing?

669
00:31:14,120 --> 00:31:14,680
Is that so?

670
00:31:15,720 --> 00:31:17,160
In that case,

671
00:31:17,600 --> 00:31:19,000
let's just wait for

672
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:20,280
Guo Zijian's call.

673
00:31:41,040 --> 00:31:42,360
Take a break for now.

674
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:43,960
I'll go call the Political Instructor.

675
00:31:44,040 --> 00:31:44,480
Yes, sir.

676
00:31:47,760 --> 00:31:49,360
Is this the tough guy you mentioned?

677
00:31:50,120 --> 00:31:51,320
He doesn't seem very bright.

678
00:31:52,720 --> 00:31:54,640
Guo Zijian isn't as simple as you think.

679
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:57,240
Besides,

680
00:31:58,000 --> 00:31:58,800
they have three other men

681
00:31:58,800 --> 00:31:59,600
who aren't on the bus.

682
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:01,800
We already found out.

683
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:03,680
The other three

684
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:04,640
took a taxi.

685
00:32:05,240 --> 00:32:06,000
Our men

686
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:07,360
spotted them

687
00:32:07,360 --> 00:32:08,520
outside a restaurant

688
00:32:09,120 --> 00:32:09,680
and are watching them now.

689
00:33:07,520 --> 00:33:08,160
Lao Sang

690
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:10,360
What's the situation on your end?

691
00:33:10,600 --> 00:33:11,760
Just don't forget,

692
00:33:11,840 --> 00:33:13,560
10:15 tomorrow morning

693
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:15,560
is the deadline to report in.

694
00:33:15,760 --> 00:33:16,400
I know.

695
00:33:18,040 --> 00:33:19,560
We ran into a little situation here.

696
00:33:20,120 --> 00:33:21,360
Staff Officer Liang

697
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,800
was framed by drug dealers,

698
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:24,400
so she won't be able to

699
00:33:24,800 --> 00:33:25,640
get away anytime soon.

700
00:33:26,840 --> 00:33:27,360
Yeah.

701
00:33:27,520 --> 00:33:28,960
I do know Captain Jing,

702
00:33:29,320 --> 00:33:30,560
and I explained it to her,

703
00:33:30,560 --> 00:33:31,320
but she

704
00:33:31,600 --> 00:33:32,280
wouldn't cut me any slack.

705
00:33:32,280 --> 00:33:33,280
There's nothing I can do.

706
00:33:34,400 --> 00:33:35,160
That's why they say,

707
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:37,000
the prettier the woman,

708
00:33:37,160 --> 00:33:38,120
the less you can trust her.

709
00:33:40,240 --> 00:33:40,920
Xiaochun,

710
00:33:41,080 --> 00:33:42,000
did you hear that?

711
00:33:42,400 --> 00:33:44,040
He says you can't be trusted.

712
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:46,120
I heard him.

713
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:47,880
Staff Officer Liang isn't with us right now.

714
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:50,480
Both cameras have been blocked.

715
00:33:51,360 --> 00:33:52,240
That's too much of a coincidence.

716
00:33:53,360 --> 00:33:54,880
Do you think they noticed something?

717
00:33:55,800 --> 00:33:57,240
You're overthinking it.

718
00:33:59,360 --> 00:34:01,040
All right, I got it. Understood.

719
00:34:08,440 --> 00:34:09,440
Where is Staff Officer Liang?

720
00:34:10,120 --> 00:34:10,920
We haven't found her yet.

721
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:11,760
Keep looking.

722
00:34:12,080 --> 00:34:12,480
Yes, sir.

723
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:29,600
Keep it down, guys.

724
00:34:29,680 --> 00:34:30,520
Let me get some sleep.

725
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:45,040
Are you really that fascinated?

726
00:34:46,680 --> 00:34:47,520
What are you talking about?

727
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:49,800
I'm just checking

728
00:34:50,120 --> 00:34:50,960
if there are any issues.

729
00:34:51,880 --> 00:34:53,440
Looks like there are no issues.

730
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:54,800
A bunch of grown men.

731
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:56,760
Watching any more would invade their privacy.

732
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:02,160
Liang Hong is in our hands.

733
00:35:03,120 --> 00:35:04,360
They can't pull any tricks.

734
00:35:11,640 --> 00:35:12,800
What's the situation?

735
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:15,640
I thought he had a trick up his sleeve.

736
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,440
They're actually going to sleep?

737
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:19,000
Deputy Army Commander Liang,

738
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:21,000
can we withdraw too?

739
00:35:22,520 --> 00:35:23,840
This is far from over.

740
00:35:25,080 --> 00:35:26,080
Let's keep watching.

741
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:33,920
Police surveillance feed disconnected.

742
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:53,680
Liang Hong,

743
00:36:02,640 --> 00:36:03,400
now

744
00:36:04,240 --> 00:36:05,280
I can tell you

745
00:36:05,280 --> 00:36:06,280
our entire plan.

746
00:36:07,440 --> 00:36:08,520
The so-called drug case

747
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:10,120
was all a fake.

748
00:36:11,760 --> 00:36:12,720
This mission

749
00:36:13,320 --> 00:36:14,120
was just a special operation

750
00:36:14,120 --> 00:36:15,960
targeting your eight-person squad.

751
00:36:15,960 --> 00:36:16,520
The goal

752
00:36:17,680 --> 00:36:19,520
was to keep you here for 24 hours.

753
00:36:21,760 --> 00:36:22,920
At first,

754
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,640
I thought you were all military elites,

755
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:27,720
so I even invited the SWAT team

756
00:36:27,720 --> 00:36:28,480
to assist us.

757
00:36:29,200 --> 00:36:30,760
You disappointed me more than I expected.

758
00:36:31,800 --> 00:36:32,840
You haven't even realized

759
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:33,840
our true purpose until now.

760
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:36,040
What's your point in telling me this?

761
00:36:36,600 --> 00:36:37,680
No point at all.

762
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:40,720
I'm just a little disappointed

763
00:36:42,040 --> 00:36:42,840
in Guo Zijian.

764
00:36:46,920 --> 00:36:48,280
Well, maybe that's because

765
00:36:49,200 --> 00:36:50,320
you overestimated him before.

766
00:36:53,280 --> 00:36:53,920
Is that so?

767
00:36:57,560 --> 00:36:58,120
Dongfang,

768
00:36:58,120 --> 00:36:59,400
give us a brief update.

769
00:36:59,480 --> 00:36:59,880
Yes, sir.

770
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:01,160
Outside the police command room,

771
00:37:01,160 --> 00:37:02,280
surveillance has been set up.

772
00:37:02,280 --> 00:37:03,320
It hasn't aroused suspicion yet.

773
00:37:03,320 --> 00:37:04,120
Everything is normal.

774
00:37:04,200 --> 00:37:05,600
There are three sentry posts in the villa,

775
00:37:05,720 --> 00:37:06,760
and they have visibly relaxed.

776
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:08,640
The bus is under tight surveillance,

777
00:37:08,640 --> 00:37:09,360
and there's no issue there.

778
00:37:09,720 --> 00:37:10,320
But

779
00:37:10,520 --> 00:37:11,440
Staff Officer Liang's room

780
00:37:11,440 --> 00:37:12,560
cannot be confirmed at the moment.

781
00:37:17,160 --> 00:37:18,640
The main gate has the most cameras.

782
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:20,080
It's the critical node.

783
00:37:20,640 --> 00:37:22,120
The sentry posts inside the villa

784
00:37:22,120 --> 00:37:23,080
must all be taken down.

785
00:37:23,680 --> 00:37:24,880
Then we take the sentries,

786
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:25,840
lock them up together,

787
00:37:26,080 --> 00:37:27,240
and change into their uniforms.

788
00:37:27,440 --> 00:37:28,080
And then?

789
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:30,200
We escort the bus out.

790
00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:31,880
After getting out...

791
00:38:15,440 --> 00:38:15,880
Everyone,

792
00:38:16,040 --> 00:38:16,520
follow me!

793
00:38:16,520 --> 00:38:17,040
Yes, sir!

794
00:38:46,560 --> 00:38:47,960
Why are the buses heading out now?

795
00:38:49,560 --> 00:38:51,560
What game is Jing Xiaochun playing?

796
00:38:52,080 --> 00:38:52,640
Report!

797
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:53,600
We have a situation.

798
00:38:53,800 --> 00:38:54,800
Guo Zijian is missing.

799
00:39:08,360 --> 00:39:09,240
Captain Jing, no one's here.

800
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:11,000
No one here.

801
00:39:11,600 --> 00:39:12,120
No one here.

802
00:39:13,280 --> 00:39:13,800
Captain Jing.

803
00:39:14,040 --> 00:39:15,760
A bus just drove out the gate.

804
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:16,400
Also...

805
00:39:16,400 --> 00:39:18,480
several SWAT officers lost their uniforms.

806
00:39:19,760 --> 00:39:20,480
What is this?

807
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,080
The Empty Shell?

808
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:24,680
Liang Hong!

809
00:39:25,400 --> 00:39:25,800
Hurry!

810
00:39:25,800 --> 00:39:26,200
Hurry!

811
00:39:26,200 --> 00:39:26,840
Hurry!

812
00:39:40,040 --> 00:39:40,600
Captain Qi,

813
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:41,480
Liang Hong is still here.

814
00:39:59,080 --> 00:40:00,080
Lure the tiger from the mountain.

815
00:40:00,800 --> 00:40:01,400
Exactly.

816
00:40:03,640 --> 00:40:04,920
It's 'lure the tiger from the mountain.'

817
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:09,280
The timing is perfect.

818
00:40:53,720 --> 00:40:56,280
The Empty Shell without bloodshed. Genius.

819
00:40:57,800 --> 00:40:59,400
Too bad you still saw through it.

820
00:41:01,280 --> 00:41:02,600
But with only you here,

821
00:41:03,200 --> 00:41:04,200
can you stop me?

822
00:41:05,160 --> 00:41:05,880
To deal with you,

823
00:41:06,720 --> 00:41:08,040
I'm more than enough.

824
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:17,240
Let me.

825
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:20,720
He's no match at all.

826
00:41:21,600 --> 00:41:22,760
Battalion Commander Guo won't lose.

827
00:41:24,600 --> 00:41:26,000
Of course I know he won't lose.

828
00:41:27,080 --> 00:41:28,280
I meant Captain Qi.

829
00:41:32,720 --> 00:41:33,920
You know Guo Zijian very well.

830
00:41:34,360 --> 00:41:35,400
Of course I do.

831
00:41:37,640 --> 00:41:38,640
He saved my life.

832
00:41:39,280 --> 00:41:40,600
I almost pledged myself to him.

833
00:42:06,640 --> 00:42:07,720
Not bad.

834
00:42:08,200 --> 00:42:08,920
Passable.

835
00:42:50,880 --> 00:42:51,640
Aren't you ashamed?
